## 2. Important: your TikTok account's country matters

Because you're currently in Cambodia but selling to UK businesses, check the advertising-account registration before spending anything.

TikTok's published location matrix does not list the UK as an available target for ordinary self-serve advertising accounts registered in Cambodia. UK-registered accounts can target the UK. Account registration involves genuine business and billing information, so this is a matter of setting up the account correctly, not simply changing your location with a VPN.

