For paid advertising, Facebook is worth testing because it reaches existing trades-business owners, including older proprietors who may be interested in someone setting up AI for them.

TikTok is an interesting route to younger electricians who are already filming jobs, experimenting with software and building their own businesses. But popular electrician videos also attract apprentices, hobbyists and consumers, so views alone won't tell you whether you're reaching buyers.

## What do actual ads cost?

Published UK agency estimates vary considerably. One September 2026 agency report gives indicative Facebook clicks of £0.30–£1.50, while another UK B2B agency reports £15–£40 per Facebook lead and £35–£75 per Google lead from its 2025 B2B campaigns.

